    "name": "Humane by Design",
    "descriptionZh": "一份关于数字福祉的设计指引站点，以三条原则为骨架，配文章与 Garden 里按标签归档的短记录。",
    "takeawayZh": "拿走三条数字福祉设计原则，当产品评审的检查清单。",
    "noteZh": "首屏深色底，左边两行大标题 Humane by Design，配一句 Guidance for designing humane digital products and services focused around digital well-being. 和一个 Learn More 链接，右边一幅巨大的同心圆弧图形；顶部一条浮动导航条上排着 Principles / Articles / Garden / Resources / Info 五项。正文里 Principles 一节列的是 Empowering、Finite、Inclusive，Latest Article 是《The Cost of Personalization》（2024-01-23），Latest Seeds 三张卡标着 Planted Apr 20 / Feb 19 / Feb 7，挂 Context、Privacy、Calm 等标签。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
